# W9 r3: fx's install rule against a `/rename` typed while the first turn
# runs (installGeneratedTitle, session_title_generation.zig:378-394). The
# title comes back after the rename, so it finds the user's title on record
# and is dropped (`user_title_present`): the window and the status line keep
# `Mine`, the log's last title fact is the rename, and `/trace`'s
# `## Session Title` says the generation was dropped.
gateway titles-rename-turns.json
titled titles-late-answer.json
seed titles-seed.json
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 3
type fix the renderer loop, it redraws every row twice
key Enter
wait 1
type /rename Mine
key Enter
wait 9
snap renamed
title renamed
type /trace
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap trace
reports report
gwlog
home files
